[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/0e620fd3688ab40f9913b2894a8cfc46ac97bd9e.png[/img]

Warriors!

Here comes the Bounty Week! Go on a treasure hunt in Dungeons, Tombs, and Outposts, fight vile bosses and take part in Guild battles for tons of trophies! There are even more rewards up for grabs in Dungeons as a tribute to the wonderful lady heroes of Arinar – so miss none of these:
[list]
[*] legendary Demonologist's, Snorlar’s and Рink Troll costumes can now drop in all Dungeons on heroic and mythical difficulties (with the higher drop rate in higher level dungeons);
[*] rarest non-class Books of Enhanced Attack Speed and Enhanced Skill Cooldown can now drop in all Dungeons on mythical difficulty (with the higher drop rate in higher level dungeons);
[*] x2 drop rate for all equipment (weapon, armor, and accessories) in all Dungeons;
[*] x2 drop rate for accessories (rings and bracelets) in all Tombs and Outposts;
[*] x2 drop rate for all equipment (weapon, armor, and accessories) from all bosses and mini-bosses;
[*] x2 drop rate for costumes and books from all raid bosses;
[*] x2 drop rate for Storyteller Balvizar, Nocturna, Rottung Air costumes, and non-class Books of Desert Majesty, Power of Spirit, Power of Life from treasuries for Guild events: Horrors of Dunes, Music of Magic, Wild Hunt;
[*] x2 drop rate for non-class Books of Critical Frenzy and Threatening Humility from Tribal Chests;
[*] x2 drop rate for non-class Books of Absolute Strength and Might of the Depths from Pirate Chests;
[*] x2 Guild Points in all Dungeons.
[/list]
But spare some time for your own Reputation too as you pave the way for spring! This week brings some neat Reputation and Knowledge multipliers for successful Dungeon runs and raid boss battles!
[list]
[*] x2 Reputation daily cap with the Elders of the Adventurers/Assassins Guild for completing the Ancient God's Temple Dungeon;
[*] x2 Reputation daily cap with the Mermen of the Depths for completing the Sea Tramps’ Lair Dungeon;
[*] x3 Knowledge daily cap for completing Dungeons;
[*] x2 Knowledge in all Dungeons.
[/list]
And don’t miss out on a sweet 60% off all Smileys in the Miracle Shop to meet the spring up in arms!

Event duration: 04.03 12:00 CET – 11.03 11:00 CET

Forward, for trophies!
The Warspear Online Team

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/d352e15ffe878a48906b0f87e65d27b52213e4a1.png[/img]

Warriors of Arinar!

The time has come to strengthen your Guilds and prove their power and glory – and grab some fine rewards alongside! Don’t miss out on this Week Event which offers a great opportunity to bolster your Guilds, and leave a prominent mark on Arinar’s history! 
[list]
[*] 50% off leveling up a Guild from 1-12 levels (less Guild Points and Gold needed);
[*] 50% off studying passive Guild Skills on any Guild level (less Guild Points and Gold needed);
[*] 50% off studying active Guild Skills on any Guild level (less Guild Points and Gold needed);
[*] 50% off renaming a Guild;
[*] x2 Knowledge at Guild Events: Filth's Dungeons, Lords of the Depths, Grove of Black Elm, Rusty Wastelands, Music of Magic, Wild Hunt, In Search of the Almonomicon, and Horrors of Dunes;
[*] x2 Guild Points in all Dungeons.
[/list]
More than that, throughout this week any Guild player can freely venture into the Champions Colosseum Guild Dungeon, and the Past Priest's Temple Dungeon on any difficulty level. This means that an additional Guild level requirement has been lifted for both Champions Colosseum and the Past Priest's Temple! In this vein, this week also brings exclusive Dungeon rewards:
[list]
[*] H'Ton and Heavy-Handed Jabbar costumes may now drop in the Champions Colosseum Dungeon (with the higher drop chance for higher difficulty levels);
[*] 2 rewards for each successful run in the Champions Colosseum Dungeon on easy, normal, high, and heroic difficulties;
[*] 3 rewards for each successful run in the Champions Colosseum Dungeon on mythical difficulty;
[*] 3 rewards for each successful run in the Past Priest's Temple Dungeon on mythical difficulty.
[/list]
On top of that, be sure to compete for 10 winning places in the Guild Tournament (required for the Non-Fading Glory achievement):
1-3 Ranks: x2 Crimson Corundum for victory in the Guild Tournament
4-10 Ranks: all Guilds members will be rewarded with Crimson Corundum and a Bronze Coffer

Event and tournament span: 12.02 12:00 CET – 19.02 11:00 CET

See you in the game!
The Warspear Online Team

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/2e4bd86e310dff02f199283601a52f65e4c76c8d.png[/img]

Warriors of Arinar!

The South Pole is on the brink of defeat! Corporation’s minions are almost fleeing the Snowy Bound, so now is your turn to strike the final blow! Meet the Winter Bounty Week which brings some rich bounties for challenging the vile invaders, put by the White Beard himself!
[list]
[*] Gryla, North Pole Cat, South Pole Cat and Milk Hare costumes may now drop in all festive Dungeons (with the higher drop chance in higher level dungeons);
[*] the rarest non-class Books of Enhanced Resistance and Enhanced Solidity may now drop in certain festive Dungeons, including Silas's Explosives Factory, Silas's Squib Factory and Silas's Fireworks Factory (with the higher drop chance in higher level dungeons);
[*] x2 drop chance for unique weapons with the Rage bonus in all festive Dungeons;
[*] x2 drop chance for unique weapons with the Piercing Attack bonus in all festive Dungeons;
[*] x2 drop chance for unique accessories (rings, bracelets, amulets and cloaks) with Physical / Magical Power and the Rage bonus in all festive Dungeons;
[*] x2 drop chance for unique armor (head, body, hands and legs) with the Resistance bonus in all festive Dungeons;
[*] x2 drop chance for unique belts with combat bonuses in all festive Dungeons.
[/list]
Take your courage to challenge bosses of the Snowy Bound, make a stand against raid bosses Mr. Ping and Mrs. Knott,  take an active part in world and Guild events, and make sure to earn World Creation Magic to contribute your best to the Guild Tournament! Don’t miss double chance to grab the finest of White Beard’s rewards:
[list]
[*] x2 drop chance for unique armor (head, body, hands and legs) with the Damage Reflection bonus from bosses on the Snowy Bound;
[*] x2 drop chance for Mr. Ping and Mrs. Knott costumes and the non-class Book of Enhanced Piercing Attack from raid bosses Mr. Ping and Mrs. Knott on the Snowy Bound;
[*] x2 drop chance for the Blasting Bang Bang costume from a coffer for the festive world event South Pole Breakthrough;
[*] x2 drop chance for the Frost costume and the non-class Book of Enhanced Fury from a treasury for the festive guild event Kasanita’s Wrath;
[*] x2 drop chance for the Assault Tormentoise costume and the non-class Book of Rapid Fury from a treasury for the festive guild event Turtlehood;
[*] x2 drop chance for non-class Books of Enhanced Damage Reflection and Enhanced Resistance from a chest for the festive Guild Tournament of the World Creation.
[/list]
Beyond that, this week will bring more World Creation Magic, greater score gain for the Alliance Tournament, and even more Good Luck Tokens and Guild Points!
[list]
[*] x3 World Creation Magic daily cap for all festive Dungeons;
[*] x2 World Creation Magic in all festive Dungeons;
[*] x2 World Creation Magic for all festive quests;
[*] x2 World Creation Magic for all festive dynamic quests;
[*] x2 World Creation Magic for killing raid bosses on the Snowy Bound;
[*] x2 points for the Winter Flavor Tournament in all festive Dungeons and Attractions;
[*] x1.5 Good Luck Tokens in all festive Attractions;
[*] x3 Guild Points in all festive Dungeons.
[/list]
The Bounty Week may well be quite an excellent time to take a wander through the Icy Caverns below the Snowy Bound, with x2 drop chance for the rarest rewards from Ice Chests! You will need a special key to open an Ice Chest, so the White Beard took every precaution!
[list]
[*] x2 drop chance for Ice Chest Keys from South Pole Caches;
[*] x2 drop chance for Ice Chest Keys in festive Dungeons, including Silas's Cracker Factory, Silas's Pyrotechnics Factory, Silas's Explosives Factory, Silas's Squib Factory and Silas's Fireworks Factory;
[*] x2 drop chance for Favoniy's, Wulturn's, Auster's and Aquilon's costumes, and non-class Books of Revelation of Fury and Piercing Rage from Ice Chests.
[/list]
Besides, we dare you to compete for one of the 10 winning places in the festive Guild Tournament (required for the Non-Fading Glory achievement):
1-3 Ranks: x2 Crimson Corundum for victory in the Guild Tournament
4-10 Ranks: all Guilds members will be rewarded with Crimson Corundum and a Bronze Coffer

Event and tournament span: 29.01 12:00 CET - 05.02 11:00 CET

More than that, the Season Party is coming round to make a nice ending for the World Creation celebration! Score x3 Season Points for all daily and weekly missions of the 22nd Activity Season from 28.01 23:00 CET until 04.02 23:00 CET!

See you on the Snowy Bound!
The Warspear Online Team

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/fdcd1ec209eaae52b0cf8205bfecfd6d898be423.png[/img]

Warriors!

The year 2023 is about to become history, and the Arinar chronicle is to capture the glorious deeds of both Alliances. The passing year has certainly been a landmark for Warspear Online, as we explored Arcanicum on the Blissful Isle, discovered various talent branches, celebrated the 15th Anniversary, and gained quite a foothold on Almahad! The new year is ahead, along with ever greater discoveries and memorable adventures!

We take the chance to wish happy holidays to each Warspear Online player! We’re thankful to you for being involved, attentive and supportive for the game. Be sure there’s still lots of content ahead!

Now is just the perfect time to see the coming year in on grand scale, and cheer yourself up at the Arinar’s New Year’s Party with...
[list]
[*] x3 Guild Points in all festive Dungeons;
[*] the x3 daily Knowledge cap for Dungeons;
[*] x3 Knowledge in Dungeons;
[*] the x3 daily World Creation Magic cap for all festive Dungeons;
[*] x3 World Creation Magic in all festive Dungeons;
[*] x2 Winter Flavor Points in all festive Dungeons and Attractions;
[*] x1.5 Good Luck Tokens in all festive Attractions;
[*] the 50% off for the following offers in the New and Noteworthy section: Sneaky Raccoons Smileys, Unicorns Smileys, Festive Kolobki Smileys, Keeper of World Creation Smileys, Jolly Penguins Smileys and Winter Smileys; as well as Holiday Barber Kit, Polar Barber Kit and Snow Barber Kit; and also Snowy Bound Vintage Chest.
[/list]
Event span: 29.12 12:00 CET - 01.01 11:00 CET

Come and join the celebration, yet spare some time for winter tournaments of the Snowy Bound! Score points for the Alliance tournament and earn World Creation Magic for the guild tournament to prove yourself deserving of a great reward from the White Beard himself!

Please note that the Warspear Online support team is going on vacation starting from December 29, 2023, and will get back to you only after January 9, 2024. You’re still good to reach other players for help, either on the forum, or in communities, or in the game!

See you next year!
The Warspear Online Team

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/e03be75a79f7c0fd4bebb799a47829f88b381460.png[/img]

Hunters of vampires!

The resistance of Ordo Draconis in Morsilvania is nearly broken, but there is no time to relax! Monsters and bosses of the holiday island are eagerly seeking revenge, and the Prince of Median Night has prepared exceptionally generous rewards for capturing villains! Don't miss the Week of Thrilling Bounty!
[list]
[*] costumes “Uzmak the Cruel”, “Master Tarrinis”, “Velorina de Rouen” and "Original" were added in all holiday Dungeons (the drop rate increases with the level of the dungeon);
[*] the rarest classless Book of Enhanced Stunning and Book of Enhanced Steal Health were added to holiday Dungeons  "Residence of Dreadful Baron", "Residence of Delirious Baron" and "Residence of Bloody Baron" (the drop rate increases with the level of the dungeon);
[*] exclusive heroic armor sets (head, body, arms and legs) with "Steal Health" set bonus were added to the holiday Dungeons as an additional possible reward:
[/list]
armor of 18 and 20 levels: Dungeon "Residence of Brutal Baron"
armor of 22 and 24 levels: Dungeon "Residence of Dreadful Baron"
armor of 26 and 28 levels: Dungeon "Residence of Delirious Baron"
armor of 30 and 32 levels: Dungeon "Residence of Bloody Baron"
[list]
[*] x2 drop chance of unique weapon with the “Steal health” bonus in all holiday Dungeons;
[*] x2 drop chance of unique weapon with the “Stun” bonus in all holiday Dungeons;
[*] x2 drop chance of unique accessories (cloaks, bracelets, rings, and amulets) with physical/magical power and the “Steal health” bonus in all holiday Dungeons;
[*] x2 drop chance of unique accessories (rings and bracelets) with physical/magical power and the “Stun” bonus in all holiday Dungeons;
[*] x3 Guild points for completing all holiday Dungeons.
[/list]
This week brings you a doubled chance to receive valuable rewards for defeating the bosses of Morsilvania, participating in world and guild events, and slaying the raid boss! And don't forget about the holiday guild tournament!
[list]
[*] x2 drop chance of unique armor (head, body, hands, legs) with “Steal health” bonus from bosses at the Horror Circus;
[*] x2 drop chance of “Sebastian” costume and classless Book of Enhanced Stunning from the raid bosses Sebastian at the Horror Circus;
[*] x2 drop chance of "Clarissa" costume from Ordo Draconis' Chest (holiday world event “False Track”);
[*] x2 drop chance of “Baron Karoy” costume and classless Book of Enhanced Steal Health from Gray Lodge Treasury (holiday tournament guild event “Hunter vs Hunter”); 
[*] x2 drop chance of “Torturer” costume and classless Book of Distortion of Life from Bone Army Treasury (holiday guild event “Buried Bones”);
[*] x2 drop chance of classless Book of Threatening Sap and classless Book of Secret Power of Vampirism from Morsilvania's Chest (weekly guild tournament “Median Night Tournament”).
[/list]
Moreover, you have a unique chance to earn more event “Essence of Horror” currency to level up the event talent tree, as well as get more Good Luck Tokens! 
[list]
[*] x3 increased the daily limit of “Essence of Horror” currency for completing all holiday Dungeons;
[*] x2 increased the amount of “Essence of Horror” currency for completing all holiday Dungeons;
[*] x2 increased the amount of “Essence of Horror” currency for completing all holiday tasks;
[*] x2 increased the amount of “Essence of Horror” currency for participating in killing raid-boss at the Horror Circus.
[*] х1,5 Good Luck Tokens in all holiday Attractions.
[/list]
10 prizes in the Guild Tournament (counts towards the “Non-fading Glory” achievement) await combat unions of Arinar:
Places 1-3: x2 Crimson Corundums for winning the Guild Tournament;
Places 4-10: all Guild members will receive Crimson Corundums and a Bronze Coffer.

Event time: 04.12 12:00 CET - 11.12 11:00 CET

The Season Party will help to brighten the anticipation of the long-awaited winter holidays! From 03.12 23:00 CET to 10.12 23:00 CET the amount of Season Points for completing all daily and weekly missions of 21st Season of activities will be increased by 3 times. 

Go ahead, for battle trophies!
AIGRIND

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/9080b5ef998bf95bc1d4d1ab51dd2ff39fc4e9fb.png[/img]

Dear friends!

This autumn will bring a bountiful harvest of new adventures, exciting events, and incredible rewards! And to make the wait for the arrival of Sam Hain and his Horror Circus in Arinar more enjoyable, the Bounty Week is here! Embark on journeys into Dungeons, Tombs, and Outposts, bravely fight mini-bosses, bosses, and raid bosses, participate in guild events, and don't forget to open Tribal and Pirate Chests!
[list]
[*] Black Troll Costume, Blue Troll Costume, Green Troll Costume, Red Troll Costume and Purple Troll Costume were added to all Dungeons of heroic and mythic difficulty levels (drop chance increases with level and difficulty of a dungeon);
[*] rarest classless books Enhanced Attack Speed and Enhanced Skills Cooldown were added to all Dungeons of mythic difficulty level (drop chance increases with level of a dungeon); 
[*] x2 drop chance of all equipment (weapon, armor and accessories) in all Dungeons;
[*] x2 drop chance of accessories (rings and bracelets) in all Tombs and Outposts;
[*] x2 drop chance of all equipment (weapon, armor and accessories) from all mini bosses and bosses;
[*] x2 drop chance of costumes and books from all raid bosses;
[*] x2 drop chance of Storyteller Balvizar, Nocturna, Rottung Air costumes and classless books Desert Majesty, Power of Spirit, Power of Life from treasuries for Horrors of Dunes, Music of Magic and Wild Hunt Guild events;
[*] x2 drop chance of classless books Critical Frenzy and Threatening Humility from Tribal Chests;
[*] x2 drop chance of classless books Absolute Strength and Might of the Depths from Pirate Chests;
[*] x2 the daily limit of Knowledge for completing Dungeons;
[*] x2 Guild points for completing all Dungeons.
[/list]
Event time: 23.10 13:00 CEST - 30.10 11:00 CET

Go ahead, for battle trophies!
AIGRIND

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/5c63c1bd44587bd9a81dd1058f28070d999e5145.png[/img]

The Conquerors of Almahad!

The fame of the growing power of the non-player guilds of Adventurers and Assassins has spread far beyond the Chainless League island! It's time to solidify the achievements in the dungeons, where special rewards can be obtained this week!
[list]
[*] the rarest classless book “Enhanced Accuracy” was added to all Dungeons of mythic difficulty level (drop chance increases with level of the dungeon);
[*] the unique costume "Imprisoned Alvaasr” was added to “Ancient God's Temple” Dungeon (drop chance increases with level and difficulty of a dungeon);
[*] 2 guaranteed rewards for completing easy, normal, hard, and heroic difficulty levels of the “Ancient God's Temple” Dungeon;
[*] 3 guaranteed rewards for completing the mythic difficulty level of the “Ancient God's Temple” Dungeon;
[*] x2 reputation points with "Elders of the Adventurer/Assassin Guilds" for completing “Ancient God's Temple” Dungeon;
[*] x2 daily reputation limit with "Elders of the Adventurer/Assassin Guilds" for completing “Ancient God's Temple” Dungeon;
[*] x2 the amount of Knowledge for completing Dungeons;
[*] x2 the daily limit of Knowledge for completing Dungeons;
[*] x2 Guild points for completing all Dungeons.
[/list]
Event time: 16.10 13:00 CEST - 23.10 12:00 CEST

Go ahead, for battle trophies!
AIGRIND

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/955569e24fb8c94f5fb5ae9bd7cb1f92bfd69fa0.png[/img]

Gladiators, have time to compete for rewards in the new LXXXVIII Arena season!

The most courageous warriors will discover new skills, the PvP-skills “Arena Warden’s Assistance” and “Wrath of the Gladiator”, and will also replenish their collection with the unique “Dragonborn's Great Armor” costume!

In addition, in the first two weeks, the number of Imperials of Greatness received in daily rewards will be increased by 2 times:
- from 06.10 00:00 CEST to 13.10 00:00 CEST in "Arena 5x5" mode;
- from 13.10 00:00 CEST to 20.10 00:00 CEST in "Temple of Seals 4x4" mode.

Also in the first week, 06.10 00:00 CEST - 13.10 00:00 CEST, the amount of Knowledge for victories in the arena will be increased by 2 times!

In this season, 06.10 12:00 CEST - 03.11 12:00 CEST, the following modes will become available:
- Arena 2x2;
- Arena 3х3;
- Temple of Seals 4x4;
- Arena 5x5.

Note that the level categories have been changed: 
- 23-26;
- 27-30;
- 31-34.

A complete list of awards can be found in the Arena menu in the game.

We wish you great victories!
AIGRIND

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/78f7c95ad51eee79b3d2676be53391e5ca83978d.png[/img]

All hands on deck!

In Arinar, the holiday event “Pirate Day” is starting, so real sea raiders will have the chance to prove themselves by earning reputation with various factions through completing dynamic tasks and guild events, dungeons, and killing raid bosses! Please note, this event will last for a full two weeks!
[list]
[*] unique costumes “Mad Baltemir” and “Sea Witch” were added to all heroic and mythic Dungeons (drop chance increases with level and difficulty of a dungeon);
[*] rarest classless books "Enhanced Skills Cooldown", "Physical Toughening" and "Magical Toughening" were added to all Dungeons of mythic difficulty level (drop chance increases with level of the dungeon);
[*] x2 Guild points for completing all Dungeons;
[*] x3 daily reputation limit with the faction “Mermen of the Depths” for completing “Sea Tramps’ Lair” Dungeon;
[*] x2 reputation points with the faction “Mermen of the Depths” for completing “Sea Tramps’ Lair” Dungeon;
[*] x2 reputation points with the faction “Thunderbird/Albatross Pirates” for completing “Assault of the Ship” guild event;
[*] x2 reputation points with the faction “Mermen of the Depths” for completing “Descent into the grotto” guild event;
[*] x2 reputation points with the faction “Mermen of the Depths” for completing “Invasion of Chaos” tournament guild event;
[*] x2 reputation points with the faction “Mermen of the Depths” for participation in the “Trials of the Mermen” guild cup event;
[*] x2 reputation points with the faction “Mermen of the Depths” for completing dynamic quests in the Ship Graveyard;
[*] x2 reputation points with the faction “Mermen of the Depths” for participation in killing raid-bosses Orcinus and Captain Giant Octopus.
[/list]
Don't forget to open pirate chests and fill bags with treasures!
[list]
[*] x2 drop chance of Pirate Chest Keys in “Sea Tramps' Lair” and “Mermen Sanctuary” dungeons of all difficulty level;
[*] x2 drop chance of Pirate Chest Keys from Caches of the Ship Graveyard;
[*] x2 drop chance of classless books “Absolute Strength” and “Might of the Depths” from Pirate Chests;
[*] х2 amount of Pirate Doubloons when opening Pirate Chests.
[/list]
Moreover, 20 prize places in the tournament “Invasion of Chaos” guild event (counts for the “Lords of Chaos” achievement) awaits you: all winners will receive the “Treasury of Chaos”, “Absolute Fury” buff and “Mermen of the Depths” reputation as rewards!

Event time: 11.09 13:00 CEST - 25.09 12:00 CEST

Fair winds!
AIGRIND

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/6d94bb1acaebe8ddbfbc48d0b7a8a3e8d6576923.png[/img]

Brave warriors!

After the adventure-filled summer break in Warspear Online, it's quite tempting to settle down with some books! The "Rush of Knowledge" event, which is about to begin in Arinar, will be quite timely here! This week, you have a unique opportunity to enrich your personal library with a truly valuable book:
[list]
[*] rarest classless books "Enhanced Penetration", "Enhanced Critical Hit" and "Enhanced Accuracy" were added to all Dungeons of mythic level (the drop rate increases with the level of the dungeon);
[*] expert skill books for every class (180 in total!) were added to all Dungeons of hard, heroic and mythic levels;
[*] x2 drop chance of classless books "Enhanced Critical Hit", "Power of Spirit” and "Power of Life” from treasuries for “Invasion of Chaos”, “Music of Magic” and “Wild Hunt” guild events;
[*] x2 drop chance of classless books “Absolute Strength” and “Might of the Depths” from Pirate Chests;
[*] x2 drop chance of classless books "Magic Extension", “Magic Resistance”, "Physical Protection", “Magic Protection”, "Improved Critical Damage" and "Enhanced Critical Healing" from raid bosses Orcinus, Captain Giant Octopus, Engineer, and Black Elm-tree;
[*] x2 drop chance of skill books for every class from bosses on the Ship Graveyard;
[*] x2 Guild Points for completing all Dungeons.
[/list]
Event time: 21.08 13:00 CEST - 28.08 12:00 CEST

A pleasant end to the summer will be the Season Party: from August 21, 00:00 CEST to August 28, 00:00 CEST, the number of Season Points for completing all daily and weekly missions will be increased by 3 times! Hurry up to the Activity Center for coveted rewards!

See you in the game!
AIGRIND

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/9080b5ef998bf95bc1d4d1ab51dd2ff39fc4e9fb.png[/img]

Dear friends!

The celebration of the 15th anniversary of Warspear Online is coming to an end, but there are still many grand events ahead! Thanks to the Summer bounty week and a special week event with valuable rewards, you can already dive into the refreshing whirlpool of adventures!
[list]
[*] legendary "Snorlar's Costume" and “Bloody Claw Costume” were added in all Dungeons of heroic and mythic difficulty levels (the drop rate increases with the level of the dungeon);
[*] rarest classless books "Enhanced Resistance" and “Enhanced Solidity” were added to all Dungeons of mythic difficulty level (drop chance increases with level of the dungeon);
[*] 3 guaranteed rewards for completing any Dungeons of mythic difficulty level;
[*] x2 drop chance of unique holiday accessories (cloaks, rings and amulets) with physical/magical power and Resistance and Solidity bonuses in all Dungeons of mythic difficulty level and "Colosseum of Champions" dungeon of all difficulty level;
[*] x2 drop chance of "Primordial King" costume from Chest of Ancestors (holiday world event “Hidden in the Sands”);
[*] x2 drop chance of "Snorlar's Costume" costume and the classless books "Enhanced Resistance" and “Enhanced Solidity” from Snorlar's Treasury (holiday guild event “Fiery Mouth”);
[*] x2 drop chance of "Bonewinged Guard Costume", "Beholder's Costume" and "Demonologist's Costume" and classless books "Enhanced Skills Cooldown",  "Enhanced Penetration" and “Enhanced Attack Speed” from treasuries (holiday guild events “Deathly Gaze”, “The Flame of Wrath”, “Lost Soul”).
[*] x2 Guild points for completing all Dungeons;
[*] x2 the amount of Knowledge and daily limit of Knowledge for completing Dungeons;
[*] x2 reputation points and daily reputation limit when completing Dungeons "Rotting Garden", "Termitary", "Tree of the Seas﻿ons" "Technopolis" and "Sea Tramps' Lair".
[/list]
Event time: 07.08 13:00 CEST - 14.08 12:00 CEST

Go ahead, for battle trophies!
AIGRIND

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/be6f1be24cd58fbadfe46f4f577cd02bc228b583.png[/img]

Dear friends!

Warspear Online is celebrating its 15th anniversary! Throughout all these years, unforgettable adventures have unfolded in the vastness of our fantasy world, legendary battles have taken place, and truly strong friendships have been forged. For many of us, Arinar has become a place where each person creates their own unique story, where every battle becomes epic, and every alliance is sincere and unbreakable.

This significant milestone is a testament to the unwavering support of the player community from all around the world, and today we sincerely thank you for your attention and loyalty to the project! Together, we have created and enriched Warspear Online, as it is your victories and achievements that make our world vibrant and inspiring. In the future, Arinar awaits even more amazing and thrilling adventures, and we are delighted to share these incredible moments with you!

And now, it's time to properly celebrate the game's anniversary! Invite your friends and join in the universal merriment!
[list]
[*] x3 Guild points for completing all Dungeons;
[*] x3 increased the daily limit of Knowledge for completing Dungeons;
[*] x2 increased the amount of Knowledge for completing all Dungeons;
[*] x3 daily reputation limit for completing “Rotting Garden”, “Termitary”, “Tree of the Seasons”, “Technopolis” and “Sea Tramps’ Lair” Dungeons;
[*] x2 reputation points for completing “Rotting Garden”, “Termitary”, “Tree of the Seasons”, “Technopolis” and “Sea Tramps’ Lair” Dungeons;
[*] full sets of holiday hairstyles will be available in the Miracle Shop with 50% discount: Devil's Barber Set, Evil Barber's Kit, Demon Barber's Set, Christmas Hair Stylist Set, Polar Barber's Kit, and Snow Barber's Kit hairstyles.
[/list]
Event time: 10.06 10:00 CEST - 13.06 10:00 CEST

See you in the game!
AIGRIND

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30831945/8fe1c68a649fdee553223a55c5594b08d051f9b9.png[/img]

Dear friends!

It is a good tradition to celebrate the beginning of summer in Arinar with two special events at once, which will certainly please you! Hurry up to earn as much Knowledge as possible to develop your talents and strengthen your hero, and don't forget about the generous rewards for trials that the Mermen have prepared for you!
[list]
[*] x3 increased the daily limit of Knowledge for completing all Dungeons;
